WEBVTT

00:10.844 --> 00:12.387
Hey, move! Out of the way!

00:14.597 --> 00:15.598
Hey, Yeon Si-eun!

00:18.685 --> 00:20.645
Is it true that you're staying?

00:22.897 --> 00:23.732
Yeah.

00:28.820 --> 00:30.655
I heard Hu-min joined the Union.

00:31.865 --> 00:33.366
And he's not answering his phone.

00:39.664 --> 00:41.291
It's because of us, isn't it?

00:42.125 --> 00:43.376
He felt bad for us.

00:45.628 --> 00:48.214
He thought we were suffering
because of him.

00:52.802 --> 00:53.636
But still,

00:55.305 --> 00:56.848
we should bring Hu-min back.

01:00.977 --> 01:04.064
Hey, Baku, Baek-jin told you
to make it quick and simple.

01:05.774 --> 01:09.444
Is that him? From Hyeongshin?
He's a fucking poser.

01:09.527 --> 01:10.779
This is gonna be fun.

01:11.946 --> 01:13.198
Fuck, he's tall.

01:14.532 --> 01:16.367
What the hell is up with his eyes?

01:16.868 --> 01:17.994
He's acting tough.

01:18.995 --> 01:20.163
Do you have a smoke?

01:26.377 --> 01:28.338
- Hey, he hit Baku.
- It's a clean hit.

01:35.011 --> 01:35.845
All done?

01:40.809 --> 01:41.768
Fuck.

01:52.737 --> 01:54.030
Shit, we're fucked.

01:54.114 --> 01:55.448
Hey, what do we do?

02:03.957 --> 02:05.750
Hey! Wait!

02:06.501 --> 02:07.627
It's over.

02:14.259 --> 02:15.093
Why?

02:18.513 --> 02:19.347
What's over?

02:46.082 --> 02:48.835
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

03:49.854 --> 03:50.688
Great job.

04:18.633 --> 04:19.634
What's this?

04:22.428 --> 04:23.805
Give it to your father.

04:27.016 --> 04:28.935
Are you a fucking charity?

04:29.978 --> 04:31.062
I told you before.

04:31.854 --> 04:33.356
He'll have to pay a fine.

04:37.819 --> 04:38.861
You give me this…

04:41.698 --> 04:43.783
to make me do more fucked-up stuff?

04:46.077 --> 04:47.620
You'll take it anyway.

04:49.914 --> 04:52.000
Does it feel better
when you talk like that?

04:55.545 --> 04:56.379
How on earth…

04:59.799 --> 05:01.301
did you end up like this?

05:13.104 --> 05:14.564
Baku, where are you going?

05:17.567 --> 05:18.735
What's with that punk?

05:45.595 --> 05:48.306
Hey! Baek-jin!

05:48.389 --> 05:50.183
Enough! That's enough!

05:51.100 --> 05:52.352
You'll kill him, man!

05:54.854 --> 05:55.938
Why did you stop me?

05:57.565 --> 05:59.150
I learned it all from you.

06:27.220 --> 06:28.888
It must be tough for Baku

06:29.931 --> 06:31.432
to climb this every day.

06:33.643 --> 06:37.730
That's why Baku's stamina
is so fucking high.

06:43.069 --> 06:43.903
Hey, Baku!

06:47.573 --> 06:48.574
Hey, Park Hu-min!

06:51.786 --> 06:53.704
I told you he wouldn't be here.

06:55.498 --> 06:57.417
Seriously, where is Baku?

06:59.544 --> 07:00.378
Hey, brats.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.631
What the hell?

07:04.757 --> 07:05.758
Hello.

07:12.932 --> 07:14.475
Mr. Park, how have you been?

07:17.186 --> 07:18.187
How do you think?

07:23.484 --> 07:24.610
Why are you here?

07:25.611 --> 07:26.446
Oh, well--

07:26.529 --> 07:30.658
When did Hu-min stop coming home?

07:32.577 --> 07:35.580
Goodness, that senseless fool.

07:36.372 --> 07:38.624
He didn't get enough beatings as a kid.

07:39.459 --> 07:42.962
He's just like his mom,
so I never know what he's thinking.

07:43.504 --> 07:44.464
Hey.

07:44.547 --> 07:45.882
If you see him,

07:46.382 --> 07:50.344
tell him to die out there
or come back and learn how to fry chicken.

07:51.053 --> 07:53.598
Damn, that fucking imbecile.

07:54.474 --> 07:57.977
Did Hu-min do something to you?

08:00.813 --> 08:01.647
What?

08:03.441 --> 08:06.777
Hu-min isn't a senseless fool at school,

08:07.528 --> 08:09.113
nor a fucking imbecile.

08:10.448 --> 08:12.366
He really cares about his friends,

08:12.950 --> 08:14.702
and they like him a lot.

08:16.329 --> 08:17.580
I don't think that

08:18.998 --> 08:20.541
Hu-min is the problem.

08:21.292 --> 08:23.169
I think you're the problem.

08:25.922 --> 08:27.089
Hey, you little punk.

08:31.427 --> 08:32.261
Get out.

08:34.138 --> 08:35.723
Get out, you damn punks!

08:37.517 --> 08:38.351
Yes, sir.

08:38.434 --> 08:39.310
Get out now!

08:39.393 --> 08:40.228
Let's go.

08:41.145 --> 08:42.063
Please excuse us.

08:42.563 --> 08:43.481
See?

08:43.564 --> 08:45.566
I told you we shouldn't have come.

08:47.068 --> 08:50.863
Baku used to stay at my place
whenever his dad got drunk.

08:51.948 --> 08:53.449
Mr. Park was scary.

08:56.202 --> 08:57.078
Na Baek-jin.

08:58.496 --> 09:00.206
Why does he need Hu-min?

09:03.417 --> 09:05.044
Didn't they used to be friends?

09:05.753 --> 09:08.214
Yeah, they were fucking BFFs.

09:10.299 --> 09:13.135
Back in middle school,
Baek-jin did nothing but study.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.680
He couldn't even look kids in the eye.

09:18.975 --> 09:19.809
And?

09:23.813 --> 09:25.398
Baku taught Baek-jin

09:26.732 --> 09:27.567
how to fight.

09:32.446 --> 09:35.700
I no longer teach anybody

09:35.783 --> 09:37.785
how to fight.

09:52.049 --> 09:54.051
Yeah, it's lunchtime!

09:54.135 --> 09:56.387
EUNJANG HIGH SCHOOL

10:01.767 --> 10:04.145
You know Hu-min joined the Union, right?

10:05.229 --> 10:06.439
So what?

10:08.482 --> 10:11.068
I can't reach him.
Do you know where he is?

10:11.152 --> 10:12.737
How should I know?

10:12.820 --> 10:15.906
Even if I knew, why would I tell you?

10:16.616 --> 10:18.743
I don't like the way you fucking talk.

10:19.619 --> 10:21.787
Answer him while he's still asking nicely.

10:21.871 --> 10:24.624
Goddamn it! You're just Baku's lackey.

10:24.707 --> 10:26.334
You want to go? Now?

10:32.923 --> 10:33.758
Okay.

10:34.967 --> 10:36.010
Sorry.

10:38.012 --> 10:40.139
So just tell us where Baku is.

10:43.517 --> 10:44.977
You're nothing.

10:47.563 --> 10:50.608
Well, he's probably polishing balls
at the bowling alley.

10:50.691 --> 10:52.902
If not, he might be
at Daesung Motorcycles.

10:54.028 --> 10:55.112
"Daesung Motorcycles"?

10:55.613 --> 10:57.740
Man, you don't even know that?

11:03.120 --> 11:03.954
Now…

11:05.456 --> 11:06.957
First off, the bowling alley.

11:12.797 --> 11:14.090
- Who's next?
- It's me!

11:15.174 --> 11:18.594
Na Baek-jin is a manager
at the bowling alley.

11:18.678 --> 11:20.513
But it's just to launder money.

11:21.305 --> 11:22.139
Launder money?

11:22.223 --> 11:23.224
Money laundering.

11:24.475 --> 11:27.812
The owner is some kind of gangster,
so he uses it to launder money.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.064
He manipulates the sales

11:30.147 --> 11:33.567
and hires Union boys
so he can inflate their pay.

11:36.112 --> 11:40.324
The money from Daesung is also illegal,
so he launders that money there too.

11:42.118 --> 11:44.078
Daesung Motorcycles. What do they do?

11:45.955 --> 11:47.206
Those crazy punks…

11:48.791 --> 11:51.252
They steal motorcycles, scooters,

11:51.752 --> 11:53.879
basically any type of bike.

11:55.923 --> 11:57.842
They repaint them, change the plates,

11:57.925 --> 11:59.927
change the parts to make them untraceable,

12:00.010 --> 12:02.138
and then sell them, yeah.

12:05.141 --> 12:07.643
They also keep a list of everything…

12:12.398 --> 12:16.068
make copies of the keys,
then steal the bikes back later.

12:17.987 --> 12:19.363
Wait. That doesn't make sense.

12:19.947 --> 12:21.198
Won't it get reported?

12:21.282 --> 12:22.992
Reported? You're nuts.

12:23.492 --> 12:25.494
Hey, there's no use reporting it.

12:25.578 --> 12:27.997
They only use cash or burner accounts.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.540
The gangsters might be

12:29.623 --> 12:30.624
in on it as well.

12:31.500 --> 12:32.460
And the police?

12:32.543 --> 12:34.920
I hear they turn a blind eye to it all.

12:36.922 --> 12:39.383
Why do the Union boys work for Baek-jin?

12:39.467 --> 12:41.260
That's so simple.

12:41.844 --> 12:43.304
The pay is fucking good.

12:43.387 --> 12:44.430
Just think about it.

12:44.513 --> 12:46.807
Fuck, they do a few errands
for a few million won.

12:46.891 --> 12:49.393
That's why those punks lose their minds.

12:49.894 --> 12:52.313
And you know Baku is fucking poor too.

12:52.396 --> 12:55.608
Fucking asshole!
What do you know? I'll kill you. Shit.

12:57.818 --> 12:58.652
Let's go.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.281
Hey.

13:03.657 --> 13:06.619
What are you up to?
Are you going after Baek-jin?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.045
I mean, you know,

13:16.754 --> 13:19.673
I have some unfinished business
with that son of a bitch.

13:19.757 --> 13:22.384
We could fucking join forces, yeah?

13:22.468 --> 13:24.553
Get him when he's alone, yeah?

13:24.637 --> 13:26.472
Gang up. Gang up on him, yeah?

13:27.097 --> 13:30.017
Let's find and kill him.
Hey, should I make some calls?

13:30.100 --> 13:34.605
Hey, Si-eun! Seriously, man.
Fuck, should I round up the boys?

13:37.066 --> 13:38.484
We don't need your help.

13:40.236 --> 13:41.070
What?

13:44.573 --> 13:45.950
What a fucking idiot.

13:56.126 --> 13:57.086
What?

13:59.797 --> 14:00.631
What?

14:08.389 --> 14:12.601
Hey, should we get a Union guy
and find out where Daesung Motorcycles is?

14:13.310 --> 14:15.396
I think that's where Baku would be.

14:23.571 --> 14:26.866
So… we can fight again and get hurt?

14:29.076 --> 14:29.910
No.

14:32.830 --> 14:34.248
Don't do anything yet.

14:36.166 --> 14:37.209
I have a plan.

14:38.836 --> 14:39.670
Please.

14:45.342 --> 14:46.927
Hey, what's your plan?

14:48.178 --> 14:49.847
Am I supposed to just sit around?

14:50.723 --> 14:53.142
Who knows what
Baku might be up to right now?

14:58.188 --> 14:59.023
Whatever.

15:23.547 --> 15:27.051
USE THIS

15:38.896 --> 15:40.439
BAEK-JIN SENT A PHOTO

15:40.522 --> 15:43.025
76 YEONGDEUNGPO-RO 10-GIL,
YEONGDEUNGPO-GU, SEOUL

15:59.917 --> 16:00.751
What is this?

16:02.169 --> 16:03.963
Go to that address and pick it up.

16:07.383 --> 16:08.217
What?

16:09.218 --> 16:10.052
Go steal it.

16:11.512 --> 16:13.806
If you want to protect
the people you care about.

16:26.443 --> 16:33.450
AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING ACADEMIC ABILITY
JUNIOR, NA BAEK-JIN

16:39.707 --> 16:40.582
We're just…

16:43.627 --> 16:44.878
childhood friends.

17:02.855 --> 17:05.024
Damn, so close! Fuck!

17:06.275 --> 17:08.068
You can't organize those, fucking idiot.

17:08.152 --> 17:10.904
- Why not?
- Because we'll get in trouble.

17:10.988 --> 17:12.197
It's fine.

17:12.698 --> 17:14.658
Hey, isn't he that punk?

17:15.284 --> 17:16.410
- What?
- Who is he?

17:17.119 --> 17:17.953
Just a minute.

17:19.496 --> 17:20.330
Hey.

17:21.123 --> 17:22.124
What do you want?

17:23.667 --> 17:24.918
Where's Na Baek-jin?

17:28.088 --> 17:29.048
Hey!

17:35.804 --> 17:38.182
- That punk is looking for Baek-jin.
- Why?

17:38.891 --> 17:42.019
He's the guy that beat up
Geum Seong-je last time.

17:44.104 --> 17:44.980
That guy?

17:47.733 --> 17:50.986
Hey, are you the fucking lunatic
that beat up Seong-je?

17:52.738 --> 17:55.365
I've been fucking curious about you.

17:56.658 --> 17:58.494
Nice to meet you. Put it there.

17:59.411 --> 18:00.621
Where's Baek-jin?

18:05.959 --> 18:07.252
Why do you want him?

18:08.712 --> 18:10.422
I have something to say to him

18:11.298 --> 18:12.633
but nothing to say to you.

18:20.641 --> 18:22.559
This guy really is a fucking lunatic.

18:24.394 --> 18:26.396
Well, Baek-jin is coming soon.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.606
Just wait a bit.

18:28.315 --> 18:30.275
You can play a round if you're bored.

18:31.860 --> 18:33.445
Hey, turn off the signs.

18:33.529 --> 18:34.738
- Sure.
- We aren't open.

18:37.825 --> 18:39.535
DAESUNG CORPORATION

18:39.618 --> 18:42.788
Tak, should we really be doing this?

18:43.288 --> 18:45.165
Hey, let's just find it first.

18:47.126 --> 18:49.128
I think this is the right place.

18:51.547 --> 18:52.840
Is it that way?

18:52.923 --> 18:55.634
No, I think this is it.
Daesung Corporation.

18:55.717 --> 18:57.678
YEONGJIN INDUSTRIES

18:57.761 --> 18:59.138
Then we can just go in.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.973
- Come on.
- Hey, wait.

19:01.723 --> 19:03.016
Is this right?

19:03.100 --> 19:06.937
There is no Daesung Motorcycles.
This was the only place I found.

19:08.147 --> 19:11.984
Don't you think
we should listen to Si-eun?

19:12.067 --> 19:16.196
Hey, if we wait around like this,
will Baku return on his own?

19:19.199 --> 19:20.701
We have to do something.

19:28.917 --> 19:29.751
Hey.

19:30.878 --> 19:34.089
Just a minute. Hey. Slowly.

19:38.427 --> 19:39.261
Motorcycles!

19:39.344 --> 19:40.929
- Motorcycles?
- Tons of them!

19:41.513 --> 19:42.347
Just a second.

19:44.391 --> 19:46.518
Hey. Shit, why are you so heavy?

19:47.519 --> 19:48.604
You're so heavy, man.

19:48.687 --> 19:49.646
DAESUNG CORPORATION

19:49.730 --> 19:51.315
This is it! The Daesung Corporation sign!

19:51.398 --> 19:53.317
- Is this the right place?
- I think so.

19:58.155 --> 19:58.989
Are you okay?

19:59.072 --> 20:01.617
Yeah, I'm fine. Hey, did you see it?

20:01.700 --> 20:05.037
- Yes, the sign said "Daesung Corporation."
- Good job.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.955
Then let's wait nearby.

20:07.039 --> 20:10.000
I'm sure if we wait long enough,
we'll see Baku.

20:10.918 --> 20:12.252
Good job. Okay.

20:12.336 --> 20:13.378
- Okay.
- Nice job.

20:14.630 --> 20:18.967
WESTERN SEOUL HIGH SCHOOLS' UNION
ROADS WITHOUT CCTV

21:05.973 --> 21:09.101
GOTAK

21:21.029 --> 21:22.489
The number you have dialed…

21:24.408 --> 21:25.492
He won't pick up?

21:27.369 --> 21:28.537
Nope.

21:30.247 --> 21:31.206
Son of a bitch.

21:34.376 --> 21:37.129
This device is switched off.
Please leave a message…

21:37.212 --> 21:39.047
Man, that freaking jerk!

21:39.131 --> 21:39.965
What is it?

21:52.728 --> 21:53.562
Hey.

21:54.688 --> 21:56.940
What's gotten into you?

22:03.155 --> 22:04.239
Hey.

22:06.074 --> 22:08.493
Hey, Park Hu-min! I know you're in there.

22:09.786 --> 22:10.954
Come out, you punk!

22:11.038 --> 22:12.414
Union guys might be inside.

22:12.497 --> 22:14.958
No way. We haven't seen anyone for hours.

22:16.752 --> 22:17.586
Hey, Baku!

22:18.503 --> 22:20.505
Park Hu-min! Hey, Baku!

22:21.006 --> 22:24.384
I don't think he's here.
Let's get out of here and rethink this.

22:26.553 --> 22:27.387
Let's go in.

22:29.556 --> 22:30.891
Go in here?

22:32.809 --> 22:35.812
No, Tak! What are you going to do?

22:36.688 --> 22:39.232
Hey, this guy has some freaking balls.

22:39.316 --> 22:40.942
He fucking came here alone.

22:41.610 --> 22:42.611
Hey, Baek-jin.

22:44.112 --> 22:45.822
Yeah. All right.

22:50.160 --> 22:52.079
Okay. Understood.

22:54.748 --> 22:55.582
Let's go.

22:58.377 --> 22:59.336
Hey, let's go.

22:59.920 --> 23:02.297
- Keep an eye on the place.
- Yes, brother!

23:05.258 --> 23:07.511
Just wait a bit.
Baek-jin will be here soon.

23:14.142 --> 23:15.769
You really need to lose weight.

23:16.269 --> 23:17.521
- You got it?
- Wait.

23:19.815 --> 23:20.899
Hey, I did it!

23:20.982 --> 23:22.442
I did it!

23:23.360 --> 23:24.820
Hey, are you okay?

23:26.696 --> 23:27.781
- I'm coming.
- Okay.

23:36.331 --> 23:37.916
What's all this?

23:43.922 --> 23:46.049
- Go see what's up there.
- What?

23:49.177 --> 23:50.011
Hey, Baku.

23:51.096 --> 23:51.930
Park Hu-min!

23:56.393 --> 23:58.520
Tak, he's not over here.

24:00.230 --> 24:02.232
- That's Baku's underwear!
- What?

24:02.315 --> 24:03.692
The tiger briefs. There!

24:04.359 --> 24:06.027
- What?
- Baku's briefs.

24:06.111 --> 24:07.988
- Those are Baku's?
- Yeah, they are.

24:08.488 --> 24:09.322
Shit.

24:13.910 --> 24:15.579
- So he really was here.
- Tak.

24:16.121 --> 24:17.247
- Tak.
- What is it?

24:17.330 --> 24:18.707
Those papers there.

24:19.291 --> 24:21.376
Isn't that what Hyo-man was talking about?

24:21.460 --> 24:24.796
Evidence of Na Baek-jin's crimes
or something?

24:25.839 --> 24:28.175
Yeah, I think you're right.

24:30.218 --> 24:32.095
- Hey, Jun-tae.
- Yes?

24:32.179 --> 24:33.513
I can't let this go.

24:40.729 --> 24:41.980
What are you doing?

24:42.814 --> 24:44.274
Move over a bit.

24:44.357 --> 24:46.443
- No, don't do it!
- We have to look.

24:46.526 --> 24:47.527
- It's fine.
- Hey!

25:03.668 --> 25:05.045
- Hello, brother.
- Hello.

25:05.754 --> 25:07.297
- Go outside.
- Yes, brother.

25:27.609 --> 25:29.444
I didn't expect to see you again.

25:33.532 --> 25:35.367
There's one thing I don't get.

25:37.160 --> 25:39.538
I don't know why
a top student with scholarships

25:40.038 --> 25:41.414
is caught up in Union stuff

25:42.165 --> 25:45.168
and commits crimes to earn money.

25:46.795 --> 25:48.463
There must be a reason.

25:52.050 --> 25:53.885
I don't know the reason.

25:56.263 --> 25:58.014
But Hu-min does, doesn't he?

26:03.603 --> 26:06.064
Do you think I'm doing this
because Baku knows everything,

26:07.065 --> 26:09.192
and I'm scared of him talking?

26:11.027 --> 26:11.861
No.

26:13.363 --> 26:15.657
Hu-min knows everything about you…

26:17.993 --> 26:20.078
so you think of him as your only friend.

26:25.250 --> 26:26.334
However…

26:29.212 --> 26:31.506
would Baku consider you his friend too?

26:54.237 --> 26:57.157
My boys… will get there soon.

27:03.288 --> 27:05.999
You said I had to separate
the variables, right?

27:08.585 --> 27:10.754
But I realized there's an even better way.

27:16.509 --> 27:18.303
If you remove the variables,

27:19.929 --> 27:20.972
it's much faster.

27:33.818 --> 27:36.905
Last time, Baku left here
to go save all of you.

27:38.448 --> 27:39.658
Can you do the same?

27:51.670 --> 27:52.504
Why?

27:54.589 --> 27:55.423
Are you scared?

28:12.941 --> 28:13.900
What are you doing?

28:16.194 --> 28:17.570
I said, what are you doing?

28:22.117 --> 28:22.951
Come on.

28:33.670 --> 28:35.422
What the hell are you doing here?!

28:41.469 --> 28:44.264
Hyun-tak and Jun-tae are
at Daesung Motorcycles.

28:45.223 --> 28:47.058
Union members are on their way.

28:47.600 --> 28:48.935
We need to hurry.

28:55.066 --> 28:55.900
Fuck!

29:02.157 --> 29:02.991
Park Hu-min.

29:14.836 --> 29:16.337
Si-eun, you should go.

29:23.178 --> 29:24.929
I'll be fine, so go.

29:45.533 --> 29:46.493
And the goods?

29:49.162 --> 29:49.996
"The goods"?

29:52.832 --> 29:53.833
The bike?

29:56.169 --> 29:57.253
I didn't steal it.

29:59.547 --> 30:02.592
Do what you want…
to the people in my life.

30:03.426 --> 30:04.260
What?

30:05.595 --> 30:08.389
Do whatever shitty things you want.

30:11.184 --> 30:13.019
This time, I realized that…

30:15.230 --> 30:17.273
you and I will never get along.

30:18.733 --> 30:19.734
So…

30:23.154 --> 30:25.031
don't contact me again.

30:27.867 --> 30:29.661
Let's go our separate ways.

30:48.471 --> 30:49.556
Have a nice life.

31:07.615 --> 31:10.076
- Find something, Jun-tae!
- Okay.

31:10.660 --> 31:12.579
Do you really think we'll find anything?

31:12.662 --> 31:13.746
Shit.

31:27.135 --> 31:31.890
BIKE PURCHASE RECORD

31:31.973 --> 31:33.808
DATE, PLATE NUMBER, BUYER
NUMBER OF TIMES SOLD

31:33.892 --> 31:34.934
- I found it.
- What?

31:35.435 --> 31:36.269
- You did?
- Yeah.

31:36.352 --> 31:37.645
Let me see.

31:40.356 --> 31:42.775
This looks like
a list of the stolen bikes they sold.

31:42.859 --> 31:46.070
Won't the Union collapse
if we take this to the police?

31:46.571 --> 31:48.865
Then all of Baku's problems
will be solved.

31:50.783 --> 31:52.702
Hot damn, Jun!

31:55.079 --> 31:57.790
Nice. Hey, take it. Let's get out of here.

31:58.458 --> 32:00.335
- We aren't missing anything, are we?
- No.

32:04.964 --> 32:06.341
- Hey.
- What's going on?

32:06.424 --> 32:08.384
These punks got in through the window.

32:16.017 --> 32:17.602
Hey, close the back door.

32:19.979 --> 32:22.148
Hey, little rats. Did you have fun?

32:27.570 --> 32:28.529
Jun-tae, stay back.

32:30.949 --> 32:31.783
Come on, guys.

32:34.035 --> 32:34.953
Get them.

32:36.496 --> 32:37.330
You fucker!

32:49.801 --> 32:50.635
Shit.

33:13.116 --> 33:14.117
Damn it.

33:23.251 --> 33:25.420
Hey, that's him, right? Baku's lackey.

33:27.088 --> 33:27.922
Go Hyun-tak.

33:29.799 --> 33:31.676
Jun-tae, are you okay?

33:56.826 --> 33:57.744
Man, this punk.

34:36.282 --> 34:37.450
Hey, move it. Move.

34:43.206 --> 34:45.041
This fucking piece of shit.

34:45.792 --> 34:47.752
Look at this fucker's eyes.

35:00.056 --> 35:00.890
Are you okay?

35:08.189 --> 35:09.524
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

35:12.026 --> 35:13.694
Fuck.

35:16.739 --> 35:18.074
- Jun-tae.
- Yeah?

35:18.157 --> 35:20.451
- Stay right behind me.
- Okay.

35:21.035 --> 35:21.869
Let's go.

35:24.747 --> 35:26.124
Run, Jun-tae! Open the door!

35:26.207 --> 35:27.917
- Okay!
- This fucking lunatic!

35:28.000 --> 35:28.876
Get him!

35:29.544 --> 35:30.711
Hey, hurry!

35:30.795 --> 35:32.505
- Get them.
- Get the door open!

35:33.047 --> 35:34.966
- Come here, crazy fucker!
- It's open!

35:36.467 --> 35:38.219
- Gotak!
- Jun-tae, run!

35:38.302 --> 35:39.679
- Run!
- You son of a bitch!

35:39.762 --> 35:42.431
- Come here, asshole!
- Hey, you son of a bitch!

35:47.728 --> 35:49.105
Hey, stop right there!

35:49.188 --> 35:52.024
Hey! You fuckers! Son of a bitch!
I'll kill you once I get you!

35:52.108 --> 35:54.527
- Come here, asshole!
- Hey, Jun-tae, run!

35:57.363 --> 35:58.698
Those fuckers are fast.

35:58.781 --> 35:59.824
What are you doing?

36:00.867 --> 36:02.410
- Hurry up! Go over it!
- Fuck!

36:22.930 --> 36:23.764
Hello?

36:23.848 --> 36:26.267
Hello? Is this Mr. Yeon Si-eun's phone?

36:26.767 --> 36:27.977
Yes, that's me.

36:28.561 --> 36:30.813
I'm calling
from Sungang University Hospital.

36:30.897 --> 36:33.232
Patient Ahn Su-ho
is in critical condition.

36:33.316 --> 36:36.652
I couldn't reach anyone
and found your number in the visitor log.

36:39.030 --> 36:39.906
What?

36:40.740 --> 36:44.160
Do you know how to reach his guardian
or any other family?

36:44.660 --> 36:46.537
Or maybe you can come instead?

36:48.289 --> 36:49.123
Hello?

36:51.584 --> 36:52.668
Hello?

40:45.734 --> 40:49.655
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
